{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-18","kind":"proposition","title":"三角形中大边对大角","englishTitle":"In any triangle the greater side subtends the greater angle.","book":1,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","contentId":"euclid-1-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4019ea8d8576176335b531679fa2177bfc7d8d787bd95735919d201e70c2fc05","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-18.statement","euclid-1-18.construction.1","euclid-1-18.proof.1","euclid-1-18.proof.2","euclid-1-18.proof.3","euclid-1-18.proof.4","euclid-1-18.proof.5","euclid-1-18.proof.6","euclid-1-18.conclusion","euclid-1-18.historical.1","euclid-1-18.historical.2","euclid-1-18.historical.3","euclid-1-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"47fedbf14462e58338e5172f2353738b8f9706008e7c4a09bd18f7ba7838999e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"In any triangle the greater side subtends the greater angle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中,较大的数量侧向向下移较大数量角度。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形大边对大角小边对小角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中，较长的边对着较大的角，较短的边对着较小的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8989602a363a8b069912b9fa2bc1394b2316eace219fecd26da0e9bc57a9ff1e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let ABC be a triangle having the side AC greater than AB;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ABC是三角形,其侧面大于AC;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71301a99a914db84040e567fed4c09badda019428b5892f13d4f1146c1cf80ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the angle ABC is also greater than the angle BCA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,ABC角度也大于BCA角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bf56c60e37680d88753557662fd5baf0fb55c739f50e4419799b2eac2a3b39c","citations":["euclid-1-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AC is greater than AB, let AD be made equal to AB [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)], and let BD bejoined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"用于AC超过AB让 AD 等于 AB让BD加入进来 [[I. 3](/principles/euclid-1-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b44379aa3f85d3fe225f6997e29a6514cc766826e6a44a9bd93979e886bd2918","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the angle ADB is an exterior angle of the triangle BCD,"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"ADB角是三角形BCD的外角"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f642e166fd7174508714afc8dbaa7bdbf41ff8b81658073970b38335287a526f","citations":["euclid-1-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"it is greater than the interior and opposite angle DCB. [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"大于不相邻的内角DCB [[I. 16](/principles/euclid-1-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1e17329dbd1892ab0030400080eea5bc8bbade8bdcab85646eea55898db088c5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ADB is equal to the angle ABD, since the side AB is equal to AD; therefore the angle ABD is also greater than the angle ACB; therefore the angle ABC is much greater than the angle ACB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ADB角等于ABD角,因为AB角等于AD;因此,ABD角也大于ACB角;因此,ABC角大大大于ACB角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1d931fa93f9d71bb93e0d3b59519312242271505343928fa9dd10b2bee3c689f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"凡三角形大边对大角小边对小角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在任何三角形中，较长的边对着较大的角，较短的边对着较小的角。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c9e0fa5d9780d02770275ab789f0564abb668f8ed1f0723fe862d2cf45ba17d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙角形之甲丙边大于甲乙边乙丙边题言甲乙丙角大于乙丙甲角乙甲丙角"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设三角形甲乙丙的边甲丙大于边甲乙和边乙丙。命题要说明：与较长边甲丙相对的角甲乙丙，大于与另外两边相对的角乙丙甲和角乙甲丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":11,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b7ed1e95175623619744f3777024220f3dfeb64569ad9549489849c8fbc6e3d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲丙边大于甲乙边即于甲丙线上截甲丁与甲乙等〈本篇三〉自乙至丁作直线则甲乙丁与甲丁乙两角等矣〈本篇五〉夫甲丁乙角者乙丙丁角形之外角必大于相对之丁丙乙内角〈本篇十六〉则甲乙丁角亦大于甲丙乙角而况甲乙丙又函甲乙丁于其中不又大于甲丙乙乎如乙丙边大于甲乙边则乙甲丙角亦大于甲丙乙角依此推显"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明：因为甲丙大于甲乙，所以在甲丙上截取甲丁，使甲丁等于甲乙〈本篇三〉，并连接乙丁。由等腰三角形的两底角相等，得角甲乙丁等于角甲丁乙〈本篇五〉。角甲丁乙是三角形乙丙丁的外角，因此大于与它不相邻的内角丁丙乙〈本篇十六〉；于是角甲乙丁也大于角甲丙乙。角甲乙丙包含角甲乙丁，所以角甲乙丙更大于角甲丙乙。同理，如果边乙丙大于边甲乙，那么角乙甲丙也大于角甲丙乙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-18.source","contentId":"euclid-1-18","revisionId":"euclid-1-18@raw-4019ea8d85761763","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c8ee4975e06681cf6362ccd5794215fe86e707773b992f9622168fa8469e707a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-18:euclid-1-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-18.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn